[00:13.40]1. Sing to Jehovah. His great name is highly exalted.
[00:15.10]His proud Egyptian foes, He has cast into the sea.
[00:15.10]Praise Jah Almighty;
[00:15.10]Besides him there can be no other.
[00:15.10]Jehovah is his name;
[00:15.10]He has gained the victory.
[00:15.10](Chorus)
[00:24.56]Jehovah God, Most High over all,
[00:27.42]The one who is forevermore the same,
[00:27.42]You soon will cause your enemies to fall
[00:41.96]And sanctify your holy name.
[00:41.98]2. See now all nations Opposing the Sov’reign, Jehovah.
[00:48.08]Though mightier than Pharaoh,
[00:48.16]They too will suffer shame.
[00:48.16]Judgment awaits them;
[00:48.16]They cannot escape Armageddon.
[00:48.20]Soon ev’ryone will know
[00:48.20]That Jehovah is God’s name.
[01:23.29](Chorus)
[01:23.29]Jehovah God, Most High over all,
[01:27.53]The one who is forevermore the same,
[01:31.69]You soon will cause your enemies to fall
[01:37.13]And sanctify your holy name.
